Library test improvements:

1. Separate test cases into Page Object Model page designs.
2. Separate POM pages into locator and behaviour/methods, where behaviour pages build on locator page abstractions.
3. Remove tests that navigate through the folder hierarchy.
4. Update verify page tests to not just check for visibility of locators,
    but for unique user content, therefore, verify against actual title 'text'
    not just visibility. This work has begun on the Add Compound Document tests
    but should be retro fitted to previous tests.
5. When adding text as a parameter for a function, consider creating a Json
    object of the text to keep it organised.